// Aida64SD bridge service contract.
//
// Adapted from hwinfo-streamdeck's hwservice.proto with two deliberate
// deviations:
//  1. All four RPCs are unary (the HWiNFO reference streams Sensors/
//     ReadingsForSensorID/Sources). The AIDA64 payload is a single small
//     string (~2 KB) per tick, so batching one response per call is simpler
//     and the size is not a concern.
//  2. The Sensor.sourceID and Source messages still exist for contract parity
//     with the HWiNFO plugin, but AIDA64 is local-machine only, so the bridge
//     always reports exactly one source with ID "" (see pkg/service/uid.go).

